#. “不可能”の反対語は“可能”ではない。
#. “挑戦”だ。
msgctxt "0001 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"\"The opposite of 'possible' isn't 'impossible'—it's\n"
"'challenge.'\""
msgstr ""

#. 野球選手のジャッキー・ロビンソンの言葉だよ。
msgctxt "0002 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"That's a quote from the famous baseball player Jackie\n"
"Robinson!"
msgstr ""

#. 私達も挑戦し続けないと…
#. 諦めちゃ駄目だよね…
msgctxt "0003 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"And we have to remember, this is just a challenge. We\n"
"can't give up!"
msgstr ""

#. 一緒に過ごす
msgctxt "0004 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Spend some time with Hina"
msgstr ""

#. 他の場所へ行く
msgctxt "0005 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Go see who else is around"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どうしよう？
#. 朝日奈さんを誘ってみようか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hmm... Should I talk to Hina for a while?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. オッケー！　たまには、
#. ゆっくりと、ぶらぶらしますか！
msgctxt "0007 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Okay! You wanna go for a walk? I don't care where to."
msgstr ""

#. と言っても…
#. 結局、この不気味な建物の中だけなんだけど…
msgctxt "0008 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Although, no matter where we go, we're still stuck in\n"
"this stupid school..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さんと一緒に、
#. 校内をぶらぶら歩いて過ごした。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hina and I walked aimlessly around the school...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さんと少し仲良くなれたみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hina and I grew a little closer today.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 渡す
msgctxt "0011 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes, definitely"
msgstr ""

#. 渡さない
msgctxt "0012 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Not really, no"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>プレゼント<CLT><CLT 23>を渡しますか？<CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | NARRATION"
msgid "<CLT 3><CLT><CLT 23>Would you like to give Hina a<CLT> <CLT 3>present<CLT><CLT 23>?<CLT>"
msgstr ""
